      "type": "info",
      "text": "**MATCH** returns a value's position in one row or one column: `=MATCH(value, list, match type)`. Use `0` for an exact match, including wildcard patterns; `*` stands for any characters, so `Sun*` matches anything starting with Sun. Type `1` finds the last value not above yours in an ascending list."
